    "headline": "Domain registrar GoDaddy narrows annual revenue forecast",
    "summary": "GoDaddy narrowed its annual revenue forecast and largely met second-quarter ‌estimates on Thursday, amid slower adoption ‌of AI tools and weaker customer acquisition. Here are some ​details: • GoDaddy has heavily invested in AI tools to help small and medium-sized businesses build and automate their websites. The Tempe, Arizona-based company ‌expects full-year ⁠revenue to be between $5.215 billion and $5.255 billion, compared with $5.195 billion to $5.275 billion ⁠forecast earlier.",
    "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/technology/ai/articles/domain-registrar-godaddy-narrows-annual-222835156.html",
